      "message": "I think this can be changed to:\n\n```\nIndicates whether the name of this record is expected to be fully owned by the\nentity containing the RecordInfo: either a ServiceRegistration, or the general\nrecords list.\n\nIf true, the name is \"shared\" and may be advertised by other entities (for example\nother local ServiceRegistration or other hosts on the network).\n\nIf false, only this ServiceRegistration or list of general records can contain the\nname of this record.\n```\n\nThis observes that the name of a non-shared record can only appear in a single ServiceRegistration or in the general records list; so if it\u0027s seen in one list, there\u0027s no need to check for it in other lists.",
